      "message": "The information saved here is used by the bootloader. It\u0027s not for Ramdump analysis.\nThe bootloader cannot figure out local variables from a stack frame.\n\nSo, when a reset occurs, the bootloader will generate a report using this kind of information on-device. In this case, it will include IRQ number, IRQ name, IRQ thread information in the report.",
